1
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,800
Where were you all afternoon?

2
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,240
I was asking Shengyang about some things.

3
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,720
What things?

4
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,800
It's a secret.

5
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,160
By the way, I forgot to ask.

6
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:03,800
Why did you join this lab?

7
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,080
It's a secret.

8
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,440
Professor Qiu found me.

9
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,640
He said he saw our work
in the Excellence Cup.

10
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:18,000
So you already knew I was coming.

11
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,320
Nobody told me you were coming.

12
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:26,560
Really? But you seem
to know a lot of people here.

13
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,520
Who?

14
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,600
I meant…

15
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,440
Never mind.

16
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:39,040
If you're not busy later,

17
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,320
let's get dinner.

18
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,480
Not today. I have to work at the store.

19
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,640
I'll be busy with research

20
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,360
and won't get to work as much.

21
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,840
You asked for time off. Why did you come?

22
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,400
You don't have a shift today.

23
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,720
And tell me earlier
if you want time off too next time.

24
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:11,200
When I took time off before,
when 5:30 p.m. came around,

25
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,680
what happened?

26
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,600
What do you mean?

27
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,480
Do you mean Xiaoyang?

28
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,600
He doesn't go to school every day.

29
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:31,560
Besides, when that happens,
I go to pick him up first

30
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:34,520
and take him to his grandparents.

31
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,160
Then I come back to the store.

32
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:41,240
The two elders have difficulty walking
and can't pick him up,

33
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,400
but they can watch him at home just fine.

34
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,960
Besides,

35
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,720
the special education school's teachers
are very nice.

36
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:49,760
Why do you ask?

37
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,160
I got into a school lab.

38
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:55,440
I will be taking more time off.

39
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,880
So…

40
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,520
you may need to hire another person.

41
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:18,320
You took one day off last month.

42
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,800
I deducted that.

43
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,360
This is the total. Check it.

44
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,120
- Correct?
- Yes.

45
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,320
You're fast.

46
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:28,480
Did you calculate it several times
before coming?

47
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,560
You sure won't take a loss.

48
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,600
Okay, I've transferred it to you.

49
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,240
It's good to be sharp.

50
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:43,000
Until you find another part-timer,

51
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:46,560
if you can't manage, you can contact me.

52
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,800
You worry too much.

53
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:52,320
Plenty of students
want to work here.

54
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,960
Don't worry.

55
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,680
Go on.

56
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,360
You… You go do your best.

57
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:21,600
I'll also do my best.

58
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:01,200
Mr. Lu, here's your package.

59
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:06,400
Mr. Lu, is the power outlet not working?

60
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,560
- It's fine.
- Then why are you removing it?

61
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:12,520
Didn't you put this extra-long power strip
to charge devices here?

62
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,720
It isn't needed anymore.

63
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:28,440
Only six people in the class
scored over 90 points this time.

64
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:33,160
Isn't your goal to be
in the top 35 of your grade?

65
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,280
What rank does 90 points get you?

66
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,040
Never mind. It's still worth rewarding.

67
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,120
What's the reward?

68
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,560
Did you finish
those math problems last time?

69
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,400
I can teach you.

70
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,920
It doesn't count as a lesson.

71
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,880
How is that considered a reward?

72
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,880
Give me the math problems.

73
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,800
No need. I've taken care of it.

74
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,800
I met a young teacher at school.

75
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,720
I can go to him for any problems.

76
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,000
You don't have to worry.

77
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,640
Let's start the lesson.

78
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:11,880
Okay. Today, let's go over…

79
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,000
Hello. Here's your delivery.

80
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,920
Delivery?

81
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:36,640
Let's start with where you made
the most mistakes.

82
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:40,080
In a double-stranded DNA molecule,
adenine accounts for…

83
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,120
Hello. Here's your delivery.

84
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,920
We're here for a lesson, not…

85
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,240
We're not having a picnic.

86
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,320
Okay, it won't happen again.

87
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,480
In a double-stranded DNA molecule,

88
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:09,000
adenine accounts for 20% of all bases.

89
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,120
Therefore, cytosine accounts for…

90
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,760
How many more deliveries are there?

91
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,800
I don't know.

92
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,920
Gao Xing.

93
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,080
I really don't know

94
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:28,680
because I didn't order these.

95
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:39,960
Someone already cooks for Gao Xing.
Why order so much takeout?

96
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:44,120
Even aside from that, it's all delivered
during tutoring. It's disruptive.

97
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,200
I'm taking care of her

98
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:48,720
as her cousin.

99
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,840
I never realized you were so thoughtful.

100
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,200
You're just dense.

101
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,760
I didn't order for her alone.

102
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,880
Tutoring her

103
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,800
is physical labor, not mental labor.

104
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:04,440
Besides, you're going
to be busy with the lab now.

105
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,120
I…

106
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:10,640
What's up? Is joining the lab
stressing you out?

107
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,240
It's new to me.

108
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,320
But it's okay.

109
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:19,240
The first step is always the hardest.

110
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,040
I have reading to do. See you.

111
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:52,040
It's affected by
impaired lactate metabolism.

112
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,920
The teacher mentioned it last time.

113
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:01,080
Zheng Yu.

114
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:06,080
This is the experimental project
I told you about.

115
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,200
Take a look.

116
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,880
Do you have that many questions?

117
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,680
We're the ones in a team.

118
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,640
You don't get it.

119
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,480
I had heard about it before.

120
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,840
Our boss originally wanted
to bring only you on.

121
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,440
You have experience, after all.

122
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:29,280
But Shengyang
strongly recommended Zheng Yu.

123
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,920
That's why the two of you joined
at the same time.

124
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,400
So?

125
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,240
So don't be so dense.

126
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,160
He wants to show Zheng Yu
the ropes. Let him.

127
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,040
We'll be right here,

128
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:43,680
the hidden threat that he is unaware of.

129
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,000
Wait for luck to fall into our laps.

130
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,280
Do you have free time?

131
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,280
Why aren't you working?

132
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,680
It's only 11:00 a.m.

133
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:59,280
Before 1:00 p.m., anything more complex
than brewing coffee is beyond me.

134
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:04,000
Then why did you come in so early?

135
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:06,960
You don't get it.

136
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:10,400
I need to spend all morning
convincing myself

137
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,680
to do experiments all afternoon.

138
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,000
Did you run into a problem?

139
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,080
- I can take a look.
- No need.

140
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,800
Are you coming this afternoon?

141
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,000
Yes.

142
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,680
Then let's have lunch together.

143
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,080
Not today.

144
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:37,040
I have lunch plans.

145
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,920
Didn't you hear anything I said?

146
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,280
What did you say?

147
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:52,280
I understand
that lonely and helpless feeling

148
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:55,560
of being an undergraduate in the lab.

149
00:11:56,840 --> 00:12:00,160
But that's no reason for you
to be so possessive of your classmate,

150
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,560
right?

151
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,680
Come on.
I'm older. I'll take you to lunch.

152
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,040
Bi Dezheng.

153
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,680
It means "I must get a diploma."

154
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,640
What year are you in?

155
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:14,360
Junior year.

156
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,920
Then I'm older than you.

157
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,440
Then take me to lunch, bro.

158
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:25,080
Wait up, bro.

159
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,640
You really don't have to
treat me to a meal.

160
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,880
I didn't do anything.

161
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:36,120
The materials you found for me
were very useful.

162
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:40,280
This is a nice spread. Thank you.

163
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,400
Did you add
that WeChat account I sent you?

164
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,440
Yes.

165
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:52,600
I already set up a time to talk to her.

166
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:55,400
That's great.
An undergrad classmate recommended her.

167
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,760
He met her in grad school.

168
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,440
She later went to study abroad

169
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:02,360
and now works
at that research institute you mentioned.

170
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,360
I see.

171
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:09,160
Do you plan to study abroad?

172
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:12,640
No, I'm asking for a friend.

173
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:17,280
I knew it. There's no way
you would study abroad.

174
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:25,080
Yes. How could I possibly study abroad?

175
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,960
Sorry, don't misunderstand.

176
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,800
That's not what I meant.

177
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,880
What I meant to say

178
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:35,720
is that I've looked into
studying abroad too.

179
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,960
Living expenses abroad

180
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,560
are very high.

181
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,160
Just on the issue of lodging,

182
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,640
getting student housing isn't guaranteed.

183
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,840
Even if you get approved, it costs a lot.

184
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:50,640
I think our situation now is quite nice.

185
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,840
You have a high chance
of getting into the graduate program.

186
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,720
Later, you can aim to be a postdoc.

187
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:59,400
This way, we can still work
in the same city.

188
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,320
What's wrong?

189
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,760
Nothing.

190
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:12,680
Dig in.

191
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,320
By the way, what friend

192
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,000
are you doing all this for?

193
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,360
A very important friend.

194
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:39,160
Should we eat at the cafeteria
or a restaurant?

195
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:41,480
The cafeteria is too far.
Let's stay nearby.

196
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,840
Sure. What cuisine are you thinking of?

197
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,160
Anything is fine.

198
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,800
I'll ask my roommates

199
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,880
if they have any recommendations.

200
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,960
They say there is
a good burger place nearby.

201
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:19,640
- I think it's next door.
- Let's go to the cafeteria.

202
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,200
Why?

203
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:24,600
I hate burgers.

204
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:27,080
- The cafeteria is too far.
- My treat.

205
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,560
Order anything you want.

206
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,120
Movement is medicine.

207
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,280
I don't mind walking a few more steps.

208
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,800
Zheng Yu said she was coming back.

209
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,560
Is she still not here?

210
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:50,840
Shengyang isn't back either.

211
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,520
Zheng Yu said she had plans.

212
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,960
Was it with Shengyang?

213
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:55,920
It's 1:00 p.m.

214
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,240
You can do more complex things now, right?

215
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,160
After you talk to her tonight,

216
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:16,040
tell me if you have more questions.

217
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,760
I'll figure something out.

218
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,080
No, it's okay. You've helped me enough.

219
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,480
Your friend is my friend.

220
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:23,160
Helping is only right.

221
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:24,480
Thank you.

222
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,560
Zheng Yu, you're finally back.

223
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,960
Did Chen Yanzhou
send you this research paper?

224
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,400
No.

225
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,160
Send it. I'll read it now.

226
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,040
Bi Dezheng.

227
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,760
You send it to her.

228
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,200
My phone is in the locker.

229
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:49,840
I'll send it to you.

230
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,319
What?

231
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,119
Do you want a coffee?

232
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:13,599
Coffee isn't good for my health.

233
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,520
You're acting weird today.

234
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,280
No, I'm not.

235
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:26,599
Are you mad at me for coming late,

236
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,200
not reading the paper,

237
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:30,440
and holding up our team's progress?

238
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,640
No.

239
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,360
- Then you--
- Zheng Yu.

240
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:37,760
I want to put my samples
through centrifugal washing.

241
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:39,000
Are you free to help?

242
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,680
No problem.

243
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,240
What's going on?

244
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:02,160
What is the matter with him?

245
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:05,880
T-CELL RECEPTORS
DISTANCE-BASED CLUSTERING APPROACHES

246
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,400
Yanzhou?

247
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,760
Are you preparing
for the Olympics so late at night?

248
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:24,760
Use your brain.

249
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:26,200
It's not an Olympic event.

250
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,200
What is that smell?

251
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,000
Vinegar.

252
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,320
Go home after you toss the trash.

253
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,360
You're one to talk.

254
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,040
JIANG MIAN

255
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:47,760
<i>When are you coming for pick-up?</i>

256
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:51,760
<i>Don't you deliver it to me?</i>

257
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,120
<i>That costs extra.</i>

258
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:57,680
<i>Have it ready during the morning exercise!</i>

259
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,160
Linlin, Zhuang Ning,

260
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:02,800
I'm so glad to be alive to see you.

261
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,680
Is your night class over?

262
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,440
I'm never failing another course.

263
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:09,400
The repeated course is at night.

264
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:11,400
I'm half dead after class.

265
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,640
Drink. Revive yourself.

266
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:14,680
Let's go.

267
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:17,680
Besides, don't… What's that…

268
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,840
It's…

269
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,880
Sorry.

270
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,240
Any dirty clothes to wash?

271
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,400
Something is off about you.

272
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:42,720
Zheng Yu, what happened?

273
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,360
How can we help?

274
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:49,920
If someone suddenly starts
talking to you less,

275
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,560
what's the reason?

276
00:19:57,040 --> 00:20:00,480
So you went out to eat and came back,

277
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:02,520
and his attitude towards you did a 180.

278
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:06,000
It's not that dramatic.
It's just different from usual.

279
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:08,400
Who did you go out to eat with?

280
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:11,600
An upperclassman in the lab.

281
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,280
His name is Duan Shengyang.

282
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:17,000
I've known him for a long time.
I had to talk to him today.

283
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,840
Is it possible

284
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:21,600
that he's talking less,
not because you were late,

285
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:24,040
but because of the reason you were late?

286
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:34,200
Forget it. I'm going to do laundry.

287
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:41,280
Why didn't you say anything?
Don't you usually have an opinion?

288
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:44,720
Analyzing back and forth is pointless.

289
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:48,040
Why not take action
and help Zheng Yu verify it?

290
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,680
How?

291
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:53,000
I just saw a post
from a senior in media studies

292
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:56,000
saying their college is
holding a singles mixer.

293
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:59,240
I have the ultimate plan.

294
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:06,040
Fangli, we're going
to that singles mixer later, remember?

295
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:07,600
That's not the point.

296
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:09,520
- Then what is?
- It's Zheng Yu.

297
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:11,320
Come on. He's getting away.

298
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,520
Of course I won't forget.

299
00:21:13,600 --> 00:21:16,680
But Zheng Yu finally agreed
to go to the mixer.

300
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:19,480
Don't forget to remind her not to be late.

301
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:21,560
It starts at seven this evening, right?

302
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:22,560
- Yes.
- Yes.

303
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,920
I'll call her later to remind her.

304
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,680
Call early so she leaves early.

305
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:29,840
Linghu Park is a bit far from campus.

306
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:33,120
- Being late gives a bad impression.
- Yes.

307
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:37,600
I wonder how many people
will ask for her contact info.

308
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:39,320
She should be in the lab.

309
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:42,320
Tell her to invite Shengyang

310
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,960
and join in the fun.

311
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:46,480
Good idea!

312
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:58,120
The act is finally over.

313
00:21:58,800 --> 00:22:00,920
Let's go get afternoon tea. My treat.

314
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,400
No, wait.

315
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,640
Will this work?

316
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:06,640
I think it's hard to say.

317
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,880
We've cast the line.

318
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:10,560
Whether the fish
takes the bait is up to fate.

319
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:13,080
Let's go. Come on.

320
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,960
Zheng Yu.

321
00:22:17,040 --> 00:22:17,880
Come here.

322
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:27,680
Isn't this data figure different
from what we said yesterday?

323
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:35,880
Does Zheng Yu seem different
from usual today?

324
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,880
Does she?

325
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:42,560
Her outfit today

326
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:43,480
is new.

327
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:49,320
Bro, we wear a lab coat every day.

328
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:51,360
How can you remember what she has worn?

329
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,600
She put on makeup today.

330
00:22:57,560 --> 00:22:58,600
Did she?

331
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,160
Doesn't she look the same as yesterday?

332
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,640
I lost again.

333
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:11,000
It's all your fault for distracting me.

334
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:19,000
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH
QING YI UNIVERSITY

335
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:20,160
Let's go do our laps.

336
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:22,080
I'm not going today.

337
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,840
Cover for me if they do roll call.

338
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:27,400
The dean has been
doing daily patrols lately.

339
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:29,240
Don't worry. I'm not dumb.

340
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:30,920
I won't stay here to get caught.

341
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,840
Be careful.

342
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,000
Bye.

343
00:23:48,800 --> 00:23:50,120
You're five minutes late.

344
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:52,560
Short legs make me slow.

345
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:53,800
Then why meet up here?

346
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:56,480
We had to come so far just for a handover.

347
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:57,960
"Just for a handover"?

348
00:23:58,040 --> 00:24:01,120
I have to check it.
I want a refund if I'm not satisfied.

349
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:30,520
JIANG MIAN

350
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,440
Do you know the answers?

351
00:24:39,520 --> 00:24:41,360
Why don't you just submit it?

352
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:43,200
If you fail, I'll refund you.

353
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:45,640
Don't assume
I don't know what you're up to.

354
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,680
If I fail,

355
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:48,440
I won't live to spend that money.

356
00:24:50,520 --> 00:24:53,360
You make it sound
like the teacher will eat you alive.

357
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:57,320
The dean.

358
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:05,240
Are you lying to me?

359
00:25:05,320 --> 00:25:06,640
He should be patrolling.

360
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:08,080
He wouldn't be here.

361
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:10,200
No, I really did see him.

362
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:12,320
I can testify he didn't lie.

363
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:15,320
See? I'm not that ridiculous.

364
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,280
Which classes are you two from?

365
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:29,240
What are you doing in the garden

366
00:25:29,320 --> 00:25:31,360
instead of doing your morning laps?

367
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:33,480
Speak.

368
00:25:33,560 --> 00:25:35,160
We're in Year 3.

369
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,560
We don't have to do laps.

370
00:25:36,640 --> 00:25:38,600
Sir, we're too stressed out.

371
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,480
We came out to take a break

372
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:43,120
and eat an apple to fuel up.

373
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:45,520
Year 3? Which class?

374
00:25:45,600 --> 00:25:47,480
Come on, show me your student ID.

375
00:25:50,600 --> 00:25:51,840
Come on.

376
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:57,680
"Gao Xing."

377
00:25:57,760 --> 00:25:59,120
REGISTERED CLASS

378
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:00,240
"Year 1, Class 5."

379
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:02,960
Where is yours?

380
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:13,400
"Jiang Mian."

381
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:14,960
REGISTERED CLASS

382
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:16,040
Year 2, Class 8.

383
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:19,440
One is in Year 1, the other is in Year 2.

384
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:21,200
Together, that's Year 3, is it?

385
00:26:22,280 --> 00:26:24,680
What were you doing
in the garden at this hour?

386
00:26:24,760 --> 00:26:28,360
In last week's speech,
didn't I talk about the issue of dating?

387
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:33,720
Go get your homeroom teachers.

388
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:40,880
Mr. Huang, I swear,

389
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:43,000
I was just asking him math questions.

390
00:26:47,040 --> 00:26:47,880
Sir,

391
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:50,440
this is indeed the math assignment

392
00:26:50,520 --> 00:26:52,400
that I gave to Gao Xing.

393
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:54,280
She has done an excellent job.

394
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:56,000
Look at these advanced problems.

395
00:26:56,080 --> 00:26:57,680
The steps to solving them

396
00:26:57,760 --> 00:26:59,480
are written out beautifully.

397
00:26:59,560 --> 00:27:00,400
It shows

398
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:02,920
her clear understanding of the concepts.

399
00:27:04,800 --> 00:27:06,200
- Mr. Huang, I meant--
- Sir.

400
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:09,880
Ms. Sun, it's good that you're here.

401
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:12,800
Your class's Jiang Mian

402
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,760
has so much time

403
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:16,360
that he's starting
to teach first-year math.

404
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,760
I like his enthusiasm,

405
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:19,760
but I'm afraid he will use this

406
00:27:19,840 --> 00:27:21,040
to start dating.

407
00:27:22,280 --> 00:27:24,800
Sir, this isn't early romance.

408
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:42,120
You're doing homework for others
and charging for it.

409
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:45,640
Do you approach them?

410
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:50,720
Say something. What's with this attitude?

411
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,880
Call your parents here.

412
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:55,520
Sir, I'm the one
who approached Jiang Mian.

413
00:27:57,000 --> 00:27:57,840
It's my fault.

414
00:27:58,440 --> 00:27:59,920
I led him astray.

415
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,480
We won't do it again.

416
00:28:01,560 --> 00:28:04,160
And you. Do you think
you can get away with it?

417
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:07,040
Paying others to do your homework?
Call your parents too!

418
00:28:07,120 --> 00:28:08,360
I can't.

419
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:10,680
My mom is on a business trip.
She can't come.

420
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,320
Mr. Huang knows my situation.

421
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:13,360
Yes.

422
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:16,280
Sir, Gao Xing's mother is rather busy.

423
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:18,280
She hasn't come in before.

424
00:28:18,360 --> 00:28:19,920
We communicate online.

425
00:28:21,560 --> 00:28:23,480
Your mom is busy. Call your dad in.

426
00:28:23,560 --> 00:28:24,920
That won't work either.

427
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:26,600
Your dad…

428
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:28,240
I'm not worried about myself.

429
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:30,560
I'm worried about you.

430
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,920
What for?

431
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,440
My dad has been dead for years.

432
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,800
- What happened?
- I don't know.

433
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:50,400
Here's what we'll do.

434
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:52,800
You must get an adult who can manage you

435
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:55,480
to speak with me this afternoon, okay?

436
00:28:56,120 --> 00:28:57,200
And you.

437
00:28:58,040 --> 00:28:58,920
Stand straight.

438
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,080
Charging to do homework?

439
00:29:13,560 --> 00:29:15,760
CHEN HUIMEI

440
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:25,560
<i>My dad has been dead for years.</i>

441
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:32,520
Just tell them

442
00:29:32,600 --> 00:29:34,960
I was looking for business,
and you got scammed.

443
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:41,920
You couldn't tell a lie to save yourself.
Would I fall for your scam?

444
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:45,840
I will take responsibility
for my own actions.

445
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:48,560
You should think about
how you will explain it

446
00:29:48,640 --> 00:29:50,080
to your parents.

447
00:30:16,080 --> 00:30:17,520
Why are you here alone?

448
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:19,520
Getting some air.

449
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:26,640
Today, are you going to--

450
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:29,880
Zheng Yu, did you wash the coffee machine
in the break room?

451
00:30:29,960 --> 00:30:31,880
When I was making coffee for others,

452
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:34,520
I saw it was dirty, so I washed it.

453
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,800
We're on the same team.

454
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:39,400
How come I haven't gotten any?

455
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:43,200
Didn't you say
coffee is bad for your health?

456
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:44,400
Is your health bad?

457
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:46,800
I'm very healthy.

458
00:30:53,760 --> 00:30:55,040
Rushing her already.

459
00:30:56,160 --> 00:30:57,280
What did you say?

460
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,040
I said,

461
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,920
is there a problem with the machine?

462
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,960
No.

463
00:31:04,040 --> 00:31:05,560
I just think

464
00:31:06,600 --> 00:31:07,800
Zheng Yu is a real gem.

465
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,560
I bought the machine in sophomore year.

466
00:31:13,520 --> 00:31:14,880
You know, in this lab,

467
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:17,880
other than me,
she's the first one to wash it.

468
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,600
You don't get it.

469
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:22,080
Everyone uses it to make coffee every day.

470
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:25,000
But not one person has ever washed it.

471
00:31:25,080 --> 00:31:27,280
I wash it
whenever I can't stand it anymore.

472
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:32,760
Looks like you haven't enjoyed
your two years here.

473
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,640
It's not about enjoying it or not.

474
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,280
I've been here for two years.

475
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:39,720
I don't feel like I belong.

476
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:42,680
Even now,

477
00:31:43,280 --> 00:31:46,840
whenever I come here, I feel like
I'm sneaking into someone's house.

478
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:52,840
Do all undergrads feel the same way?

479
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:54,600
Don't look at me. I don't.

480
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:02,640
But since we're a team,

481
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:05,520
get rid of that feeling and do the work.

482
00:32:14,160 --> 00:32:15,560
Zheng Yu, are you leaving?

483
00:32:17,320 --> 00:32:18,560
I have something to do.

484
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:24,000
Leaving early.

485
00:32:24,080 --> 00:32:25,600
But you don't have to leave this early.

486
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,240
Are you leaving too?

487
00:32:33,560 --> 00:32:34,600
Bye.

488
00:32:40,560 --> 00:32:41,520
Hello?

489
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:49,040
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH
QING YI UNIVERSITY

490
00:32:53,600 --> 00:32:55,480
Ms. Zheng, over here!

491
00:33:11,040 --> 00:33:13,640
How is the outfit?
I borrowed it from my roommate.

492
00:33:14,840 --> 00:33:15,800
It will do.

493
00:33:16,360 --> 00:33:17,640
Don't worry.

494
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:20,120
Mr. Huang is clueless about anything

495
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,480
outside of mathematics.

496
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:22,400
Let's go.

497
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:25,120
The phone call was too short.

498
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,920
I didn't get the chance to ask.

499
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:29,840
What's this about someone
doing your homework for you?

500
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:32,000
It's what it sounds like.

501
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,760
The young teacher you mentioned last time

502
00:33:35,840 --> 00:33:37,160
isn't really a teacher

503
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:39,400
but a boy one year above you.

504
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:43,240
And he didn't teach you math.

505
00:33:43,320 --> 00:33:45,400
He straight up did your homework for you.

506
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,440
How did you trick this young boy?

507
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,760
He's in Year 2

508
00:33:52,840 --> 00:33:56,080
and helping you instead of prepping
for the College Entrance Exam.

509
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,480
I lured him with money.

510
00:33:57,560 --> 00:33:59,040
You're quite smug.

511
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:03,240
Are you telling me the truth?
It's not dating?

512
00:34:06,520 --> 00:34:09,000
Although this boy is pretty good-looking,

513
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:12,400
from my observations,

514
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:13,840
dating him

515
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,840
would be quite boring.

516
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:18,560
You actually dared to think about it
and observe him.

517
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:24,120
You didn't tell Yanzhou
that you're coming here

518
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:25,560
to see my teacher, did you?

519
00:34:25,639 --> 00:34:27,040
If he finds out,

520
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:29,320
then my uncle and aunt will know too.

521
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:32,360
That's practically the same
as telling Chen Huimei.

522
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,159
Yanzhou and I

523
00:34:36,239 --> 00:34:38,360
might not be as close as you think we are.

524
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:44,000
I knew it.

525
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:47,800
He had to be in trouble to be
rollerblading in the middle of the night.

526
00:34:49,719 --> 00:34:51,679
Ms. Zheng, wait for me!

527
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,159
Mr. Huang.

528
00:34:57,720 --> 00:35:00,720
Gao Xing, what took you so long?
I thought you'd run off!

529
00:35:00,800 --> 00:35:03,640
Mr. Huang, school isn't over yet.
Where can I run off to?

530
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:06,280
Besides, am I that kind of person?

531
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:10,760
Who is this?

532
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,200
This is my…

533
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,200
cousin's wife.

534
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:22,960
Hello, you must be Mr. Huang.

535
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:27,000
Yes. Shall we go inside?

536
00:35:27,080 --> 00:35:30,080
The boy and his parent are inside already.

537
00:35:30,160 --> 00:35:31,280
Come.

538
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,600
You cousins look so alike.

539
00:35:35,680 --> 00:35:37,760
- Keep an eye on his studies.
- Sir.

540
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,440
- You must--
- Ms. Sun.

541
00:35:39,520 --> 00:35:41,720
- This is Gao Xing's cousin's wife.
- Hello.

542
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:43,400
This is Jiang Mian's cousin.

543
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:48,560
W… Whose cousin?

544
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:53,040
Jiang… Jiang Mian's cousin.

545
00:35:55,720 --> 00:35:57,600
Why? Is he your cousin?

546
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:13,120
Please take this seriously.

547
00:36:17,320 --> 00:36:18,800
Is the customer you mentioned

548
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:20,320
this girl?

549
00:36:22,120 --> 00:36:23,320
Yes.

550
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:26,400
Is he that young teacher?

551
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:30,720
But now I'm not sure

552
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,240
if I have amnesia.

553
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:35,640
He might be

554
00:36:35,720 --> 00:36:37,120
a distant relative.

555
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:39,760
Why else would my cousin be here?

556
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:49,760
ONE HOUR AGO

557
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,560
- Hello?
<i>- Hello?</i>

558
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:53,640
Jiang Mian?

559
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:55,160
<i>At the hospital,</i>

560
00:36:55,240 --> 00:36:57,120
<i>you said I could contact you for help.</i>

561
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:59,880
I did say that,

562
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:03,040
but I remember
you threw away my phone number.

563
00:37:03,120 --> 00:37:06,680
<i>I memorized it and didn't need it,</i>
<i>so of course I tossed it.</i>

564
00:37:07,600 --> 00:37:10,640
So did you call
because something happened?

565
00:37:10,720 --> 00:37:12,000
<i>I need a favor.</i>

566
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:14,480
<i>But you can't tell my sister.</i>

567
00:37:14,560 --> 00:37:15,400
<i>Can you</i>

568
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:17,080
<i>come to my school</i>

569
00:37:17,160 --> 00:37:18,960
<i>and handle the teachers?</i>

570
00:37:19,040 --> 00:37:20,000
Are you in trouble?

571
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:24,000
Send me the address. I'll come now.

572
00:37:25,040 --> 00:37:27,440
<i>My homeroom teacher is hard to fool.</i>

573
00:37:27,520 --> 00:37:28,720
<i>You…</i>

574
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:30,400
<i>You had better…</i>

575
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,920
I've got it. Wait for me at school.

576
00:37:35,720 --> 00:37:38,520
Sir, ma'am, let's talk about the kids.

577
00:37:39,200 --> 00:37:41,960
I will talk about Gao Xing first.

578
00:37:42,040 --> 00:37:44,640
- She hired someone to do her homework.
- I was wrong.

579
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:46,240
I will be mindful next time.

580
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:47,240
Next time?

581
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:53,480
I…

582
00:37:53,560 --> 00:37:55,920
am helping her discipline the child.

583
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:58,240
You're even doing that?

584
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:02,080
Sir, let me tell you
about Jiang Mian's problem.

585
00:38:02,160 --> 00:38:03,320
It's even more serious.

586
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:06,240
Doing homework for others
with fixed pricing.

587
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,760
This is egregious.

588
00:38:08,640 --> 00:38:10,440
This is proof of his transactions.

589
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:12,920
He even has tiered pricing.

590
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:16,000
Sometimes, he even charges double
for rush jobs.

591
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,040
I even paid quadruple.

592
00:38:23,680 --> 00:38:25,480
This is outrageous. I'm very sorry.

593
00:38:26,080 --> 00:38:27,760
Ma'am, why are you apologizing?

594
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:31,640
You… Are you all family?

595
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:35,840
Lecturing and apologizing for each other?

596
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:44,000
Sir, why are you smiling?

597
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:49,960
Well, let me ask you, are you married?

598
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,080
- No.
- Do you have a girlfriend?

599
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:55,960
No.

600
00:38:56,040 --> 00:38:57,120
I knew it.

601
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:59,120
You're clearly not as mature as her.

602
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,800
Ask her for advice when you have time.

603
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:06,120
Yes. I will give her
my contact information later.

604
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:10,320
My reason for calling you here
isn't to lecture you.

605
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:12,720
It's to understand their situations

606
00:39:12,800 --> 00:39:14,680
so this doesn't happen again.

607
00:39:14,760 --> 00:39:15,600
- Yes.
- Yes.

608
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,520
Let's do this.

609
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:22,480
When they get home, they will each write
an 8,000-character self-reflection

610
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:23,680
and submit it to me.

611
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,640
Isn't that too much?

612
00:39:26,240 --> 00:39:27,920
Right. How about fewer words?

613
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:30,520
You two are aligned on this too.

614
00:39:32,240 --> 00:39:33,720
Used to spoiling them rotten?

615
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,160
It's not much.

616
00:39:36,240 --> 00:39:37,840
Right.

617
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:40,680
It's not much.
Let's round up to 10,000 characters.

618
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,240
See?

619
00:39:42,960 --> 00:39:44,240
That's the right attitude.

620
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:47,160
Come in.

621
00:39:47,240 --> 00:39:51,160
Sir, Mr. Huang, Ms. Sun, we're waiting
for you for the grade-level meeting.

622
00:39:51,240 --> 00:39:52,800
Okay, we'll be right there.

623
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,280
Okay, let's end here for today.

624
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,560
Discipline the kids at home.

625
00:39:58,200 --> 00:39:59,080
Thank you.

626
00:39:59,160 --> 00:40:00,960
It's not easy being parents now.

627
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:10,120
Gao Xing, when did my sister
become your cousin's wife?

628
00:40:10,200 --> 00:40:12,400
When did my cousin become your cousin?

629
00:40:15,240 --> 00:40:16,160
Your cousin?

630
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:29,000
So he's the brother you said is taking
the College Entrance Exam soon?

631
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,640
No, wait.

632
00:40:32,720 --> 00:40:35,760
Why is one surnamed Jiang
and the other Zheng?

633
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:41,440
But that's normal.

634
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:43,480
Chen Yanzhou and Zhou Guanqi

635
00:40:43,560 --> 00:40:45,480
are still brothers.

636
00:40:50,560 --> 00:40:53,360
I seem to have forgotten to order drinks.

637
00:40:54,240 --> 00:40:57,000
Gao Xing, come on.
See what you want to drink.

638
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:13,680
Yanzhou, did I just say something wrong?

639
00:41:17,040 --> 00:41:19,320
Ms. Zheng's mom is surnamed Jiang.

640
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:23,640
But Jiang Mian wasn't born
with his mother's surname.

641
00:41:24,320 --> 00:41:26,640
It's because he was adopted by his uncle.

642
00:41:30,040 --> 00:41:34,320
The Lunar New Year red packet you gave me
and the money you left at the hospital

643
00:41:35,080 --> 00:41:37,520
wasn't pocket money
you got from Jiang Haixing.

644
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:40,040
A tiny portion was.

645
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:42,560
What about the rest?

646
00:41:42,640 --> 00:41:45,040
Did you earn it
from doing homework for others?

647
00:41:45,120 --> 00:41:46,640
I wanted to help you,

648
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:48,600
but I didn't know how.

649
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:49,960
No, wait.

650
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:51,120
Not help.

651
00:41:51,200 --> 00:41:53,200
It's what I should be doing.

652
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:56,320
Taking care of Mom
isn't your responsibility alone.

653
00:41:57,240 --> 00:42:00,360
Don't do this anymore.
Focus on the College Entrance Exam.

654
00:42:04,240 --> 00:42:06,440
Only if you score well can you help me.

655
00:42:08,720 --> 00:42:10,080
No.

656
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:11,440
It's not helping me.

657
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:13,920
It's your responsibility.

658
00:42:20,520 --> 00:42:21,800
Wait.

659
00:42:23,120 --> 00:42:25,040
Order a few more dishes.

660
00:42:25,120 --> 00:42:27,160
We already ordered plenty.

661
00:42:27,240 --> 00:42:29,320
Why order so much for only four people?

662
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:31,080
This way,

663
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:33,200
we can take longer.

664
00:42:37,920 --> 00:42:39,000
Take longer?

665
00:42:40,080 --> 00:42:41,280
What's up?

666
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:43,600
Will Ms. Zheng do something naughty later?

667
00:42:44,880 --> 00:42:46,080
Get going.
